# A note too long to keep. Decimus (10) writes on General, 80 characters a line (82 with the line end): 212 lines
# make 17,384 characters, and the 213th would take it past MAX_NOTE_TEXT (17,432), so the note is thrown away and
# Decimus is back in the game. (Reading a note that long would overflow printf_to_char's buffer in the C: see
# tests/test_scenarios.py.)
@connect dec
Decimus
psswrd
@return
@return
note write
all
A long note
